// Tags: fisheye, fisheye lens, barrel distortion, ultra wide, 8mm, distortion
// Size: 539x208 px · Cycle: 5 s
// Needs: kit photo -> https://showheyohtaki.github.io/motion-prompt/api/v1/kit/photo.js
// Live demo: https://showheyohtaki.github.io/motion-prompt/#110
